<title>USA: Neurex plans Phase III trials of SNX-111. [CORRECTED 22:22 GMT]</title>
<headline>Neurex plans Phase III trials of SNX-111. [CORRECTED 22:22 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Neurex Corp said it and its partner, Warner-Lambert Co, plan to begin in the first (corrects from second) half of 1997 Phase III trials for SNX-111 for the treatment of head trauma.</p>
<p>It said the study will be conducted in about 40 centers and will involved 800 patients.</p>
</text>
